    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look for your car in a series of mazes and parking lots while you talk to your therapist about why do you keep dreaming about them.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/78ffdd5464df463ae197c5b7de78998d.poster.avif?t=1754167048\" width=640 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/78ffdd5464df463ae197c5b7de78998d.webm?t=1754167048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/78ffdd5464df463ae197c5b7de78998d.mp4?t=1754167048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for your car by using your car key!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-40 minutes long.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existential story about feeling lost and creative blocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real dreams!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/0c4364571ee30086d9d686208ee47e29.poster.avif?t=1754167048\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/0c4364571ee30086d9d686208ee47e29.webm?t=1754167048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/0c4364571ee30086d9d686208ee47e29.mp4?t=1754167048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look for your car in a series of mazes and parking lots while you talk to your therapist about why do you keep dreaming about them.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/78ffdd5464df463ae197c5b7de78998d.poster.avif?t=1754167048\" width=640 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/78ffdd5464df463ae197c5b7de78998d.webm?t=1754167048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/78ffdd5464df463ae197c5b7de78998d.mp4?t=1754167048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for your car by using your car key!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-40 minutes long.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existential story about feeling lost and creative blocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real dreams!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/0c4364571ee30086d9d686208ee47e29.poster.avif?t=1754167048\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/0c4364571ee30086d9d686208ee47e29.webm?t=1754167048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500340/extras/0c4364571ee30086d9d686208ee47e29.mp4?t=1754167048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Look for your car in a series of mazes and parking lots while you talk to your therapist about feeling lost. An interactive short story about trying to make sense out of the unreal. Based on real dreams!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe writing in this game is just really good [...] There\u2019s plenty of nuance and attention to detail, something I think you can only really achieve by having lived through these experiences yourself.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 So Many Games<br><br>\u201cThe idea is really interesting, and you can tell there's a lot of love in its crafting. It's evident it's a profoundly personal project, and that's something we always need in the world of videogames.\u201d<br>PressOver<br><br>\u201cA weird way to spend $5.\u201d<br>Forbes<br>",
